{"schemaVersion":1,"id":352,"sections":[{"id":"811001-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[20579],"start":0,"count":34},{"id":"811001-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[20580],"start":34,"count":13}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"811001-PROLOGUE:20579:1","scriptId":20579,"text":"死水团长室中——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"811001-PROLOGUE:20579:2","scriptId":20579,"text":"死水的最高负责人维多利亚正在阅览一份报告书，这份报告书的内容是关于华尔兹中队的。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":547,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"811001-PROLOGUE:20579:3","scriptId":20579,"text":"“表现中规中矩啊，没什么出彩的地方。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"811001-PROLOGUE:20579:4","scriptId":20579,"text":"维多利亚把华尔兹小队以高价出借给了特勤局的特别空勤队。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"811001-PROLOGUE:20579:5","scriptId":20579,"text":"虽然她本人不是很愿意，但既然是特勤局那边先开的口，那死水这边也要有所表示。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":547,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"811001-PROLOGUE:20579:6","scriptId":20579,"text":"“这样子看，好像还是我们亏了啊，本以为那小子能通过特别空勤队搞出点什么名堂。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1114,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"811001-PROLOGUE:20579:7","scriptId":20579,"text":"“还好吧，才这么几天，您把长官他们当什么了～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":1114,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"811001-PROLOGUE:20579:8","scriptId":20579,"text":"一旁的蕾贝卡正坐在沙发上打理着自己的头发，这份报告书正是她拿来的。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":1114,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":547,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"811001-PROLOGUE:20579:9","scriptId":20579,"text":"“可能是我期望太高，当初特勤局的人跑来说要借用华尔兹中队，我还以为他们要搞什么花样呢。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":1114,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1114,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"811001-PROLOGUE:20579:10","scriptId":20579,"text":"“听父亲说是为了做给公众看，不让死水单方面出风头。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":1114,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":547,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"811001-PROLOGUE:20579:11","scriptId":20579,"text":"“说白了还是以前看扁我们，现在我们强大了又过来抱团取暖？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":1114,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1114,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"811001-PROLOGUE:20579:12","scriptId":20579,"text":"“哈哈哈，毕竟空钢方面波西娅博士做出了巨大的贡献，她的光芒非常夺目，特勤局当然会坐不住。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":1114,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":547,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"811001-PROLOGUE:20579:13","scriptId":20579,"text":"“早知道波西娅能赚那么多专利费，就应该找她分一杯羹了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":1114,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1114,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"811001-PROLOGUE:20579:14","scriptId":20579,"text":"“你现在找她也来得及啊~只不过最多只能分到一调羹。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":1114,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":547,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"811001-PROLOGUE:20579:15","scriptId":20579,"text":"“算了，死水没出现财政危机，现在资金充足。况且我也不想因为这点事情欠波西娅的人情。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":1114,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1114,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"811001-PROLOGUE:20579:16","scriptId":20579,"text":"“哈哈，也是，波西娅的人情可不好还~”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":1114,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":547,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"811001-PROLOGUE:20579:17","scriptId":20579,"text":"“蕾贝卡，谈谈正事吧。你除了这报告书以外应该还带来了别的消息，不然怎么会赖在这里不走呢。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":1114,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"811001-PROLOGUE:20579:18","scriptId":20579,"text":"维多利亚把看完的报告书折叠好放回硬壳信封中。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":1114,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1114,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"811001-PROLOGUE:20579:19","scriptId":20579,"text":"“是的，接下来我要说的事情是最近遇到的新情况，从父亲那里听来的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":1114,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":547,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"811001-PROLOGUE:20579:20","scriptId":20579,"text":"“是什么事情？特勤局又开始弄保密了？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":1114,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1114,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"811001-PROLOGUE:20579:21","scriptId":20579,"text":"“听说看到了在飞行的旅行者。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":1114,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":547,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"811001-PROLOGUE:20579:22","scriptId":20579,"text":"“关于旅行者的谜团还很多，会飞的旅行者应该不算很奇怪吧，不过我会让航空钢舞姬注意一下空中的情况。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":1114,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1114,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"811001-PROLOGUE:20579:23","scriptId":20579,"text":"“不止如此，还有目击者看到了旅行者和战车兽战斗的情况。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":1114,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":547,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"811001-PROLOGUE:20579:24","scriptId":20579,"text":"“嗯？等等……战车兽不是被旅行者控制着吗？为什么这两者会发生战斗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":1114,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1114,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"811001-PROLOGUE:20579:25","scriptId":20579,"text":"“看来团长您也没什么头绪嘛。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":1114,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":547,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"811001-PROLOGUE:20579:26","scriptId":20579,"text":"“你说的这个问题，我会注意一下，可惜现在埃普西隆和兰布达不在我们这儿了，不然还能问问她们——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":1114,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"811001-PROLOGUE:20579:27","scriptId":20579,"text":"这时候，通信机响了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":1114,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":547,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"811001-PROLOGUE:20579:28","scriptId":20579,"text":"“这里是维多利亚，有什么事情？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":1114,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":60,"speaker":"死水哨兵","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"811001-PROLOGUE:20579:29","scriptId":20579,"text":"“有六头飞行战车兽出现，请批准航空钢舞姬出击，我们这里准备使用防空炮率先迎击。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":60,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":547,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"811001-PROLOGUE:20579:30","scriptId":20579,"text":"“批准，让待命的航空钢舞姬出击，如果有其他情况第一时间汇报给我。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":60,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":60,"speaker":"死水哨兵","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"811001-PROLOGUE:20579:31","scriptId":20579,"text":"“遵命。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":60,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"811001-PROLOGUE:20579:33","scriptId":20579,"text":"维多利亚挂断了通信机。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1114,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"811001-PROLOGUE:20579:34","scriptId":20579,"text":"“这个月第4次了吧，现在飞行战车兽好像慢慢多起来了呢。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":1114,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":547,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"811001-PROLOGUE:20579:35","scriptId":20579,"text":"“是啊，感觉是时候批量招募航空钢舞姬了，光是波西娅介绍的那几个不太够用了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":1114,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"811001-EPILOGUE:20580:1","scriptId":20580,"text":"空袭警报明明是通知大家疏散和警戒用的，但在死水……警报一响，大批人员都涌出大厅去看空战了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":547,"right":1114,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"811001-EPILOGUE:20580:2","scriptId":20580,"text":"不过和往常一样，这次空战仅仅只持续了十多分钟，以航空钢舞姬的完全胜利而告终。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":547,"right":1114,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":811,"speaker":"妮科尔·奥尔巴赫","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"811001-EPILOGUE:20580:3","scriptId":20580,"text":"“今天干得很好，我们都击坠了三头，利季娅你已经完全习惯了空中作战。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":811,"right":1114,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1119,"speaker":"丹妮拉·帕伦伯格","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"811001-EPILOGUE:20580:4","scriptId":20580,"text":"“那是当然～今天状态特别好，本来还想练习一下盘旋急转，结果直接在实战里用上了～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":811,"right":1119,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"811001-EPILOGUE:20580:5","scriptId":20580,"text":"相比一直在死水做测试飞行的妮科尔，新来的丹妮拉实战经验并不足。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":811,"right":1119,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":811,"speaker":"妮科尔·奥尔巴赫","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"811001-EPILOGUE:20580:6","scriptId":20580,"text":"“不要太冒险，刚才我看你做了Ｓ型螺旋爬升接盘旋急转吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":811,"right":1119,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1119,"speaker":"丹妮拉·帕伦伯格","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"811001-EPILOGUE:20580:7","scriptId":20580,"text":"“诶嘿嘿～被你看到啦～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":811,"right":1119,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":818,"speaker":"妮科尔·奥尔巴赫","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"811001-EPILOGUE:20580:8","scriptId":20580,"text":"“那样对身体和舞装的负荷都很大，真是为你捏了把汗。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":818,"right":1119,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1119,"speaker":"丹妮拉·帕伦伯格","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"811001-EPILOGUE:20580:9","scriptId":20580,"text":"“尝试一下新姿势，应该没问题，我有把握。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":818,"right":1119,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"811001-EPILOGUE:20580:10","scriptId":20580,"text":"丹妮拉对妮科尔的忠告不以为然，这次的空袭规模很小，所以确实谈不上危险。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":818,"right":1119,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"811001-EPILOGUE:20580:11","scriptId":20580,"text":"两位完成了拦截任务的航空钢舞姬刚回到任务大厅就被一大堆人围上了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":818,"right":1119,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"811001-EPILOGUE:20580:12","scriptId":20580,"text":"除了问她们空战的感受心得以外也偶尔有人会问一些飞行战车兽的问题，被人群簇拥着的二人简直就像回归的英雄一般。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":818,"right":1119,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"811001-EPILOGUE:20580:13","scriptId":20580,"text":"让人不由得想到一句老话：物以稀为贵。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":818,"right":1119,"section":1,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
